    "detailed_description": "Synthetic Soul: Reset is a remaster of our first game in the series, remade in our new engine. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is an immersive modern life sim with in-depth robot companions. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis idea allows you to play the game your way, with the player choice being our guiding gameplay mechanic.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter a Greydoll robot is sent to your front door without buying it, you start climbing the social ladder.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nClimbing allows you to buy different houses you can move into, robot companions, outfits, and personality modules for your robots.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEarn money from odd jobs, daily stock trading, Real Estate, Commercial Real Estate, and purchasing multiple corporations and their upgrades.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat kind of person will you become once you truly have it all?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDiscover the secret of your robot, and change the world.",
